00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:05.670 align:start position:0%
 
[Applause]  give me one minute and i'll show you how  recapture enterprise can keep fraudulent  actors away from your online business  each year billions of logins are  attempted with stolen credentials by  creating synthetic accounts or taking  over real accounts hackers can post  false comments or commit fraudulent  transactions on your site  recapture enterprise learns by  monitoring real traffic on your site  recaptcha enterprise uses machine  learning to assign a score to each  request based on how likely it is  legitimate  you can use the score and choose to take  action on the request or let you through  for example you can enforce two-factor  authentication for such requests at the  login page  if the user successfully authenticates  you can then annotate the request as  legitimate  this will improve recaptcha's future  predictions for your site however if you  receive a credit card charge back you  can annotate the request as fraudulent  in addition to the score recaptcha  enterprise returns reason codes that can  help you take the right action  for example if the reason indicates an  automated bot you might throttle the  request or send posts to the moderators  recapture enterprise works with  back-ends running on third-party clouds  on-premises and google cloud  it also supports mobile as well as web  applications  so next time you're looking to keep  fraudulent bots away from your online  business without extra friction  take a minute to explore recapture  enterprise  to learn more check out  cloud.google.com recaptcha enterprise  [Music]

